      "value": "Use avatars from Pedestals?  Save these as a favorite?  Or set them as a favorite?  \n\nIf you are trying to save an avatar from another User, I would NOT agree with that.  I have avatars that are very personal to myself, and would not want other people using my own personal characters.\n\nIf you are refering to saving avatars you found in a world or favoriting avatars from the public list, then there is an entry already in, you should Upvote that entry.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
