      "value": "@{59b9afc4e46c3651b53cf856|full_name}: I would not agree with copying the avatar off another user unless the avatar is on a pedestal. I can imagine that someone (like me) spends a whole lot of hours creating an avatar they're proud of, one of their own. If people could copy this avatar easily and potentially save it, it would mean everyone could use my avatar, eliminating the private from private avatar. \n\nI am recapping what you've said in my own words for clarity sake.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
