      "value": "@{5a50e303ae715b48f1d1fbe9|full_name}: I also thought of this and came to a possible solution by showing who made the model in some way, keeping it attached to the model and always showing the original creator no matter who you stole it from personally.\n\nFor the private avatar matter, there could be an option on upload to disable stealing, or something similar. It could even default to false for already uploaded avatars.\n\nThe only other problem I could think of with this would be where to put the credits.",
