      "value": "@{5a517838b1d98804adeed7f9|full_name}: Mabye a option button on every avatar picture in the avatar tab (in vrc) where you can enable/disable some specific options such as \"allow other people to get and use your avatar\" which is turned off by default. And also add a sub option \"temporarily/keep\" where you can select \"temporarily use\" (like it is now when you lose the avatar when you log off) or \"player keep\" (to let other people be able to save the avatar as their own). I think this would be a good compromise for those who like to keep their own hard worked avatars private and let those who want to share theirs more easily.",
